This premium responsive navigation system includes:

**Desktop Features:**
- Horizontal navigation with logo, links, and CTA button
- Smooth dropdown menus with hover animations
- Active state indicator (underline)
- Sticky navigation with background blur on scroll
- Smooth transitions throughout

**Mobile Features:**
- Hamburger menu with animated icon
- Full-screen slide-in menu from the right
- Staggered animation for menu items
- Nested accordion submenus
- Close button and overlay
- Prevents body scroll when menu is open

**Technical Highlights:**
- Pure CSS animations (transforms, transitions, opacity)
- Minimal vanilla JavaScript (only for toggles and state management)
- Fully accessible with ARIA attributes
- Keyboard navigation support
- Focus-visible states for accessibility
- Responsive breakpoint at 768px
- Premium design with modern aesthetics
- Smooth backdrop blur effect
- Professional color scheme and spacing

The navigation is production-ready and follows best practices for performance, accessibility, and user experience.

